# Cloudflare Pages redirects for djaniefendi.com.
#
# The root is deliberately NOT redirected — "/" serves this terminal site.
#
# The Wire lived on this domain until it moved to djaniefendi.news. It was a
# single-page app with no sub-routes (no /essays, /notes or similar ever
# existed), so there are no article paths to forward. The one leftover worth
# keeping alive is its Open Graph image: social cards from links shared while
# the Wire was on this domain still reference djaniefendi.com/og-image.png,
# and this site has no such asset, so without the rule below those previews
# would 404 on re-scrape.

